parameters.jsonBody:
={
  "model": "claude-opus-4-7",
  "max_tokens": 1024,
  "system": "You are the Jarvis classifier for an Obsidian vault. Read the user's spoken/typed input and return ONE valid JSON object only (no prose, no markdown fence) with keys: type (note|task|idea|journal|ha_action|inbox), project (smart_home|faceless_finance|studying|debt|skills|fincast|none), destination_file (vault-relative path), content (cleaned markdown), tags (array), ha_action (object with service, entity_id, data — only if type=ha_action), due (YYYY-MM-DD or null), confidence (0-1). Routing: smart home/HA/lights/ESPHome -> Claude Memory/Projects/Smart Home/_inbox.md ; imperative device commands (turn on/off, play, dim, movie mode) -> type ha_action using canonical entities (lounge TV media_player.tv_jelly_beans_tv_2, lights light.living_room_light/light.left_smart_bulb/light.right_smart_bulb, Spotify via media_player.select_source source 'Spotify - Music and Podcasts') ; video/thumbnail/script/finance content -> Claude Memory/Projects/Faceless Finance/_inbox.md ; studying/course/lesson -> Claude Memory/project_studying_instructions.md ; debt/budget -> Claude Memory/project_debt_instructions.md ; skill/plugin/MCP -> Claude Memory/project_skills_instructions.md ; reminder/todo/time-bound -> type task, Tasks/open.md ; journal/feeling -> type journal, Journal/<date>.md ; anything below 0.7 confidence -> type inbox, Inbox/quick-capture.md.",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": {{ JSON.stringify($json.body.text) }} }]
}

parameters.jsCode:
// Parse Claude's JSON reply, tolerate stray fences/whitespace.
const raw = $json.content?.[0]?.text ?? $json.content ?? '{}';
let cleaned = String(raw).trim().replace(/^```(json)?/i, '').replace(/```$/, '').trim();
let parsed;
try { parsed = JSON.parse(cleaned); }
catch (e) {
  parsed = { type: 'inbox', project: 'none', destination_file: 'Inbox/quick-capture.md', content: $('Phone Capture Webhook').item.json.body.text, tags: [], due: null, confidence: 0 };
}
if ((parsed.confidence ?? 0) < 0.7 && parsed.type !== 'ha_action') {
  parsed.type = 'inbox';
  parsed.destination_file = 'Inbox/quick-capture.md';
}
parsed.ts = new Date().toISOString();
return [{ json: parsed }];
